Third-party licences for overlay-blueprints
==========================================

GENERATED. Do not edit by hand.

  scripts/gen-third-party-licenses.py <this repo>

Every package below is in the production dependency tree, so it is
physically present in any image built here: the compiler does not
bundle, and the built JavaScript resolves these imports at runtime.
Their own licence files do travel inside node_modules, which a Go
binary's do not, but this file states the set in one place and covers
any distribution that is not the whole tree.
The Dockerfile copies it into the image.

This repository's own source is Apache-2.0 and is in LICENSE, not here.

